  "explanation": "A year is a leap year if it is evenly divisible by 4 AND (it is not evenly divisible by 100 OR it is evenly divisible by 400). This logic can be condensed into a single return statement.",
  "reference_solution": "def is_leap_year(year: int) -> bool:\n    return year % 4 == 0 and (year % 100 != 0 or year % 400 == 0)",
